## 6. Directory Structure Overview
```
grumblejumble/
├── app/
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── ip-geo/route.js    # IP-based location resolver
│   │   └── jumble/route.js    # Foursquare search & group size filter endpoint
│   ├── globals.css            # Tailwind directives, @font-face rules, custom slider
│   ├── layout.js              # HTML root, SEO metadata, JSON-LD, font preloads
│   ├── page.js                # Core interactive client app & state coordinator
│   ├── robots.js              # Dynamic robots.txt
│   └── sitemap.js             # Dynamic sitemap.xml
├── assets/                    # Original raw brand text, logos, and .woff2 fonts
├── components/
│   ├── Footer.js              # Minimalistic footer with creator credits & links
│   ├── LocationModal.js       # Manual city/zip selection & GPS trigger modal
│   ├── MainResult.js          # Hero chosen spot card & "Decide Again" action
│   ├── Navbar.js              # Header with logo, branding, and location badge
│   ├── SearchControls.js      # Mode switch, group sizes, cuisines, radius slider
│   └── SecondaryResults.js    # Expandable peek drawer for other candidates in batch
├── lib/
│   ├── foursquare.js          # Foursquare API client & category taxonomy
│   └── groupFilter.js         # Group size scoring and pruning algorithm
├── public/
│   ├── fonts/                 # Clarity City & Playwrite AR .woff2 files
│   ├── logo.svg               # Vector brand logo
│   └── logo.png               # High-res PNG logo
├── jsconfig.json              # Path aliases (@/* -> ./*)
├── next.config.js             # Next.js image domain configurations
├── package.json               # Next 14, React 18, Tailwind, Lucide, Confetti
├── README.md                  # Complete public documentation
└── tailwind.config.js         # Brand colors, gradients, and custom font definitions
```

